# Local file storage. .gitignore already excludes it, but Docker does not read
# that: without this line `COPY . .` sweeps every uploaded file into the build
# context. On a developer machine that is tens of gigabytes, and any image built
# there would carry the uploads inside it. At runtime this path is a volume
# (FILE_SERVICE_DATA_DIR=/data), never image content.
data/
